 Reset
⍝ Empty the store and restart IDs at 1, without restarting the server.
⍝ Every access to QUOTES.quotes and QUOTES.nextId is inside :Hold 'quotes'.
 :Hold 'quotes'
     QUOTES.quotes←⍬      ⍝ stored Quote namespaces, in ascending id order
     QUOTES.nextId←1      ⍝ never reused, even after a delete
 :EndHold
